abstract: "Code to prepare the Database of Dynamic Renal Scintigraphy, train 2D and 3D convolutional neural networks that estimate the differential renal function from the raw posterior projection (summed image, temporal mosaic and sequence of frames), and reproduce the analyses and figures of the accompanying article."
keywords:
  - dynamic renal scintigraphy
  - renography
  - differential renal function
  - deep learning
  - convolutional neural networks
